{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52812","headline":"秋夜泊江[渚]（诸） 一 · 李邕","name":"秋夜泊江[渚]（诸） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜闻木叶落，疑是洞庭秋。\n中宵起□望，正见沧江流。\n□风□□□，山月隐城楼。\n[浔]（寻）阳几万里，朝夕泛孤[舟]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}